ussed Logo\n\nA Customer-First Real Estate Platform Powered by Trusted Agents, Built on Transparency.\n\n### Houssed\n\n### Search\n\n### Support\n\nemail\n\n### Download Agent App\n\nDownload on the App Store\nGet it on Google Play","score":0.46380913,"raw_content":null,"id":"bfcef5-05"},{"url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/the-green-venturez-group","title":"The Green Venturez Group | LinkedIn","content":"The Green Venturez Group is backed by over 30 years of experience in construction and redevelopment. modern technology, in-house materials, and strict quality","score":0.4120811,"raw_content":null,"id":"87d762-06"},{"url":"https://thegreenventurez.com","title":"The Green Venturez | Real Estate Developer Borivali West Mumbai","content":"Skip to content\n\nDesign Develop Deliver\n\nImage 1: The Green Venturez\n\n   Home\n   About\n   Redevelop with TGV\n   Projects\n       Completed Projects\n       On-Going Projects\n       As a Developer\n       As a Contractor\n\n   Contact Us\n\n\n\nAt The Green Venturez Group (TGV Group), we bring over\n\n30 years of expertise in residential construction,\n\nredevelopment, and new launch projects across Borivali\n\nWest, Kandivali, and Western Mumbai suburbs.\n\nAs a trusted real estate developer and builder in\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai, we have successfully delivered\n\nresidential projects including Borivali Sai Hill, Jay\n\nKrishna and Jay Sonal. We are currently developing\n\nAlfa CHSL, a MahaRERA approved new launch project\n\noffering 1 & 2 BHK apartments in IC Colony, Borivali\n\nWest. [...] West.\n\nOur in-house team of architects, engineers, and project\n\nmanagers ensures quality construction, on-time delivery,\n\nand complete transparency at every stage. From planning\n\nand approvals to handover and after-sales support, we\n\nare with you every step of the way.\n\nWhether you are a homebuyer looking for your dream home\n\nin Borivali West or a society looking for a trusted\n\nredevelopment partner in Western Mumbai, The Green\n\nVenturez Group (TGV Group) is your reliable choice.\n\nKnow More\n\nImage 2: The Green Venturez Group construction team reviewing Alfa CHSL project plans Borivali West Mumbai\n\n## our projects\n\nBorivali Sai hill\n\nView more\n\n (1) (1)\n\n## On-Going Projects\n\nI.C. Colony Road No. 2, I.C. Colony, Borivali (West) [...] I.C. Colony Road No. 2, I.C. Colony, Borivali (West)\n\nWhether you're planning a new project, seeking a trusted redevelopment partner, or ready to start your real estate journey with us. we are here to collaborate and grow with you!\n\nView More\n\n## Completed Projects\n\nLandmarks - Mumbai Surburbs\n\nFrom Jay Sonal in Kandivali to Jay Krishna in Borivali, we’ve successfully completed various project each built with unwavering attention to quality, on-time delivery, and the trust our clients expect.\n\nView More\n\nImage 4: Completed residential projects by The Green Venturez Group Borivali Mumbai\n\n0+\n\nYears of Experience\n\n0+ Years\n\n18+ Years of Redevelopment Expertise\n\n0+\n\nCompleted projects \n\n0+\n\nReputed clients\n\n## TESTIMONIALS\n\n#### What's Our Clients Say","score":0.3941782,"raw_content":null,"id":"3b4028-07"}],"response_time":0.0,"request_id":"ad539a66-a293-44ce-8e05-6a73e2f1156a"}